r noise producing items to attract it. They are scarce, so use them wisely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036880/extras/a75d19d5375497dd091c7cf38be18c88.poster.avif?t=1730128630\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036880/extras/a75d19d5375497dd091c7cf38be18c88.webm?t=1730128630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036880/extras/a75d19d5375497dd091c7cf38be18c88.mp4?t=1730128630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036880/extras/bba4edc8784373c4556884733a5d1921.avif?t=1730128630\" width=600 height=71 /></span>.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Play Solo or in Co-op </strong><br>Form a team of up to 4 players to banish evil and survive the haunted woods. Seamlessly jump in and out of sessions, teaming up with friends and strangers to work together \u2014 or sabotage each other's efforts!<br><br></li><li><strong>New game - New layout</strong><br>Every game features a new setup with key objects and tools randomly scattered across the map, making each playthrough unlike the other. <br><br></li><li><strong>Tools to Survive</strong><br>Equip yourself and your team with various tools to navigate dark woods and survive encounters with evil. <br><br></li><li><strong>Immersive Radio-Style Voice Chat</strong><br>Communicate with your team using immersive radio-style voice chat. Coordinate actions, strategize, and offer help to teammates in need!<br><br></li><li><strong>High-Stakes Challenge</strong><br>You\u2019ve got only one chance to survive. It\u2019s insta-death\u2014make it through in one sitting or face game over. Stay sharp and dont get caught!</li></ul>",
